{"4691760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wyvern Warriors", "steam_appid": 4691760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>Features</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six-directional aerial movement with smooth rotational control </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged and melee combat systems (fireball, flamethrower, melee attacks) </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy AI with patrol routes, passive and aggressive states </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave-based gameplay with dynamic enemy spawning </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outpost capture and recapture mechanics </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Task-based objectives affecting wave progression </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss encounter driven by world-state progression </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full HUD and menu UI systems </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable levels </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural character animation </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themed audio design </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introductory tutorial experience </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized visual aesthetic </p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the Wyvern Warrior</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wyvern Warriors is a third-person aerial action game that blends fast-paced combat with high-pressure multitasking. Take control of a powerful wyvern and dominate the skies as you battle enemies, capture outposts, and protect the villages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense aerial combat using fireballs and melee attacks while managing critical objectives like delivering weapons and transporting water to keep your forces alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the war escalates, a new threat emerges: Maelstrom, a towering wyvern infused with dark magic and crackling lightning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the skies or watch your outposts fall one by one.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the Wyvern Warrior</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wyvern Warriors is a third-person aerial action game that blends fast-paced combat with high-pressure multitasking. Take control of a powerful wyvern and dominate the skies as you battle enemies, capture outposts, and protect the villages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense aerial combat using fireballs and melee attacks while managing critical objectives like delivering weapons and transporting water to keep your forces alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the war escalates, a new threat emerges: Maelstrom, a towering wyvern infused with dark magic and crackling lightning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the skies or watch your outposts fall one by one.</p>", "short_description": "Wyvern Warriors is a third-person flying action game focused on fast-paced multitasking and aerial combat. ", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4691760/68ca7fd0d6b6e38a980ec0b1de2bf496c18ed218/header.jpg?t=1780962744", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4691760/9f52a685ac386100d852225c3a41a2c6cf863c2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780962744", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4691760/9f52a685ac386100d852225c3a41a2c6cf863c2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780962744", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Window